{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0185KAwNiHKqeWZYtrWQRZ3P","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_2/projects/recursive_gen_depth_est/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# recursive_gen_depth_est — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-17 06:08 UTC | 更新原因: D035 all experiments done, paper patch complete, submitted for final review R8\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n递归生成深度估计：给定文本，预测其经历了多少轮 model→data→model 递归训练循环。\\\\n**Primary contribution**: Depth Degradation Atlas + EDD metric + feature consistency findings。\\\\n详见 paper_framing.md（Plan A, D011）。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: **论文 Final Review**（D035 patch 完成，提交审稿中）\\\\n- **目标**: EMNLP 2026 Findings track, ARR May cycle (DDL May 25)\\\\n- **论文状态**: 19 页（8 页正文），编译干净，D035 全部 6 个实验结果已写入\\\\n- **实验**: 87 total (53 success, 7 negative, 10 failed, 17 killed)\\\\n\\\\n## D035 实验结果总结\\\\n| 实验 | 结论 | 论文位置 |\\\\n|------|------|----------|\\\\n| Second-seed replication | ✅ 77.15%, Δ=-1.05pp | Limitations + Appendix |\\\\n| Cross-seed transfer | ✅ 76.76%, Δ=-1.30pp | Appendix |\\\\n| Mixed-depth corpus | ⚠️ macro ok, d1 超标 | Appendix |\\\\n| Gen-length ablation | ❌ spread 9.47pp (but informative) | Appendix |\\\\n| Reference-free baseline | ❌ 53.68% < 60% | Limitations 1-2 句 |\\\\n| Ensemble reference | ❌ 73.65% < best | Limitations 1-2 句 |\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿准备\\\\n- [x] D035 实验全部完成\\\\n- [x] Paper Agent patch 写入\\\\n- [ ] **最终审稿 R8**（已提交，等审批）\\\\n- [ ] 审稿修改（如有）\\\\n- [ ] ARR 投稿提交\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 本项目分配: gpu-6000pro-2 cuda:0, cuda:1 (2× RTX 6000 Pro)\\\\n- 已消耗: ~52 GPU·h\\\\n- 当前: **空闲**（所有实验完成）\\\\n\\\\n## 教训\\\\n- DCOL: DeBERTa disentangled attention 与 contrastive loss 数值不兼容\\\\n- kill 实验时必须验证进程确实死亡\\\\n- EDD 报告必须附 bootstrap CI + p-value (D027)\\\\n- 审稿团队可能用旧版本——提交前确认 PDF 是最新编译版\\\\n- instruction-tuning 归因需实验验证因果方向（BASE U-shape vs Instruct monotonic）\\\\n- Z-score 对 tree-based 方法（RF）无理论效果——实验前应验证假设的理论基础\\\\n- 简单 mean ensemble 稀释强信号——reference model 选择比 ensemble 更重要\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D035 | 2026-05-17 | D034 修正：投稿前补 3 个高 ROI 实验（second-seed / mixed-corpu | — |\\\\n| D034 | 2026-05-16 | 目标调整为 EMNLP Findings；Tables 加 CI 完成；论文 ready for A | lora_rank_ablation_001, gpt2xl_ref_ablation_001 |\\\\n| D033 | 2026-05-16 | R5 审稿 Action Matrix：冲 Main Conference，补 LoRA rank  | baseline_battery_001, cross_scale_llama3_base_001 |\\\\n| D032 | 2026-05-16 | Llama BASE 推翻 instruction-tuning 归因：BASE 非单调 / Ins | cross_scale_llama3_base_001, cross_scale_llama3_8b_003 |\\\\n| D031 | 2026-05-16 | 反向链实验确认 depth signal 与模型链顺序无关，N4 architecture-dept | cross_model_reverse_chain_001, cross_model_recursive_chain_002 |\\\\n| D030 | 2026-05-16 | R4 审稿回应策略：全面降级 overclaiming + 补 Llama-3.1-8B base  | cross_scale_llama3_8b_003, cross_scale_qwen7b_001 |\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-15 | 域偏差叙事调整：从\\\\\\\"无偏差\\\\\\\"改为\\\\\\\"depth dominates, residual exists\\\\\\\" | w2_domain_bias_001 |\\\\n| D028 | 2026-05-15 | Cross-strategy normalization claim 从 \\\\\\\"不可修复的结构性偏移\\\\\\\"  | lr_zscore_cross_strategy_001, cross_strategy_loo_001 |\\\\n| D027 | 2026-05-15 | EDD=4 三模型一致性声明降级：Pythia 显著 (p=0.001)，OLMo 边际 (p=0. | depth_extension_binary_pairwise_002, depth_extension_gpt2xl_d4d5_001, depth_extension_olmo_d4d5_002 |\\\\n| D026 | 2026-05-15 | 修正 EDD=4 三模型声明：从\\\\\\\"均 EDD=4\\\\\\\"转向\\\\\\\"一致的 depth-4 衰减边界，统计强度分 | depth_extension_binary_pairwise_002, depth_extension_gpt2xl_d4d5_001, depth_extension_olmo_d4d5_002 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2975, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XYg221WCdZbKMQzBV1heER","session_id":"1446a884-2136-4659-bcf0-843e85ca00ce","uuid":"f2b94681-d36a-4c4d-9a92-770ea84d48ed","timestamp":"2026-05-17T09:00:36.640Z"}
