{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01697ZrdrCVx5PFiYnK8AEoN","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_2/projects/recursive_gen_depth_est/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-17\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **cross_strategy_pipeline_001** (success): Strategy classifier achieves >90% accuracy on 19 statistical features; two-stage pipeline (predict strategy then route to per-strategy depth RF) recovers cross-strategy depth accuracy to >=70% vs naive LOO 59.1% ← 基于 cross_strategy_loo_001\\\\n- **gen_length_ablation_001** (negative): Depth signal scales with passage length: 128-token passages are detectable but weaker; 512-token passages match 256-token baseline; cross-length accuracy spread ≤ 5pp ← 基于 mvp_pipeline_pythia_002\\\\n- **cross_seed_transfer_001** (success): If depth signal is an inherent property of recursive generation, an RF trained on seed=42 features should generalize to seed=43 features with cross-seed acc ≥ 75% (Δ ≤ 3pp vs within-seed) ← 基于 second_seed_replication_001\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 54 / 负向 9 / 失败 10 / 共 88\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\ngpu-6000pro-2: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_001: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_002: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_003: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_004: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_base_002: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_base_003: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_pythia_001: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_qwen_base_004: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- cross_model_olmo_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- dcol_deberta_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- cross_model_olmo_temp09_001: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- dcol_deberta_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- dcol_deberta_003: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- olmo_temp09_002: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- dcol_deberta_004: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- dcol_deberta_005: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- cross_model_loo_001: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- depth_extension_binary_pairwise_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- depth_extension_olmo_d4d5_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- pythia7b_cross_scale_001: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- wild_data_redpajama_dolma_001: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- wild_data_calibration_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- cross_scale_llama3_8b_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- cross_model_recursive_chain_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- cross_scale_llama3_8b_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2002, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01JAYSbNrPJbNAcfoRXWETEp","session_id":"1446a884-2136-4659-bcf0-843e85ca00ce","uuid":"42b10619-3c2f-4eee-8363-2f248083e55d","timestamp":"2026-05-17T09:00:51.618Z"}
